WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.310
The mystery of Block 27.

2
00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:07.640
The mystery of Block 27 is that on the site where, in the eighties, the construction of

3
00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:13.410
a large housing estate was planned, the land suddenly and without official explanation remained undeveloped,

4
00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:20.160
giving rise to many city stories about secret underground tunnels, military facilities and strange phenomena.

5
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:27.050
Although experts explain that the reason for abandoning construction was marshy ground and technical problems,

6
00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:33.680
this empty space in the heart of New Belgrade still attracts the attention of lovers of urban legends and mysteries.
